    {
      "source": "Note that this does nothing more than create a new instance.\nThe session can later be started explicitly via <a href=\"../WebSession.html#start()\"><code>WebSession.start()</code></a>\nor implicitly by adding attributes -- and then persisted via\n<a href=\"../WebSession.html#save()\"><code>WebSession.save()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "请注意，这仅用于创建新实例。会话稍后可通过 <a href=\"../WebSession.html#start()\"><code>WebSession.start()</code></a> 显式启动，或通过添加属性隐式启动，然后使用 <a href=\"../WebSession.html#save()\"><code>WebSession.save()</code></a> 进行持久化。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Typically such checks are kicked off lazily during calls to\n<a href=\"#createWebSession()\"><code>createWebSession()</code></a> or <a href=\"#retrieveSession(java.lang.String)\"><code>retrieveSession(String)</code></a>, no less than 60\nseconds apart.",
      "translation": "通常，此类检查会在调用<a href=\"#createWebSession()\"><code>createWebSession()</code></a>或<a href=\"#retrieveSession(java.lang.String)\"><code>retrieveSession(String)</code></a>时懒加载启动，且两次调用间隔不少于 60 秒。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> This method should perform an expiration check,\nand if it has expired remove the session and return empty. This method\nshould also update the <code>lastAccessTime</code> of retrieved sessions.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 此方法应执行过期检查，如果已过期则移除会话并返回空。此方法还应更新检索到的会话的<code>lastAccessTime</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This may be useful to align to different time zones or to set the clock\nback in a test, for example, <code>Clock.offset(clock, Duration.ofMinutes(-31))</code>\nin order to simulate session expiration.",
      "translation": "这可用于对齐不同的时区，或在测试中将时钟回拨，例如使用 `<code>Clock.offset(clock, Duration.ofMinutes(-31))</code>` 来模拟会话过期。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default this is <code>Clock.system(ZoneId.of(\"GMT\"))</code>.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，这是<code>Clock.system(ZoneId.of(\"GMT\"))</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default set to 10000.",
      "translation": "默认设置为 10000。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This could be used for management purposes, to list active sessions,\nto invalidate expired sessions, etc.",
      "translation": "这可用于管理目的，例如列出活动会话、使过期的会话失效等。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method can be called to force a check at a specific time.",
      "translation": "此方法可被调用以在特定时间强制进行检查。",
      "count": 2
    },
